{"version":1,"content":"<p>藝人周慧敏近日被揭以2,499萬港元沽出一洋房，持貨16年，帳面淨賺299萬。</p><p>而本月（11月）10日59歲的她，日前亦舉行生日飯局，當中她與曾同屬寶麗金唱片、被封為「寶麗金三寶（小花）」的黎瑞恩及湯寶如驚喜同框，難得Re-U掀起回憶殺，同場</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-15T20:27:51.528895+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-15T20:01:53+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-15T20:20:19.667359+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-15T20:20:19.667359+00:00","content_hash":"9fa009edf0741a1345b81c1503605e7aa08dfbfeb748f6207de6568a4947fcf2","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}